DELETE /v1/owners/{ownerId}/members/{userId}
Remove a user from the specified workspace.
Required: ownerId (path) — The ID of the workspace to return resources for; userId (path) — The ID of the user (Render object ID with a `usr-` prefix).

GET /v1/owners/{ownerId}
Retrieve the workspace with the provided ID. Workspace IDs start with `tea-`. If you provide a user ID (starts with `own-`), this endpoint returns the user's default workspace.
Required: ownerId (path) — The ID of the user or team

PATCH /v1/owners/{ownerId}/members/{userId}
Update the role of an existing workspace member.
Required: ownerId (path) — The ID of the workspace to return resources for; userId (path) — The ID of the user (Render object ID with a `usr-` prefix).; body (body)
